exports[`snapshots of what the CLI prints (AC-E4-S1-4) > the plan of the recorded messy fixture 1`] = `
"Dustin plan  (dry run: nothing is signed, nothing is submitted)
Network      testnet   ledger 4,874,327   observed 2026-09-26T04:00:22Z
Account      GAZF3X7YYCI7PHZYZDQOGPLVN2RVD37YIQG7YEY6QJW6IK224Y4R3MBK
Balance      4.0000000 XLM, minimum balance 4.0000000 XLM, spendable 0.0000000 XLM (base reserve 0.5000000)
Destination  GBQGFM635UIV2BTCTYSMKKJBESY47VXZLCIPGKW3GZJSSY6B45U2DH2C
Sponsor      GBISNFQ4KAM62Z22MGKULQ7PI6H3RVMMWJZTWU6NP2DAIYAVN7XYQN4K
Fees         bid up to 0.0001500 XLM (100 stroops per operation), paid by the sponsor; the account pays 0
Budget       5.0000000 XLM per close for the sponsor; the bid above is within it
Status       CLOSABLE: the plan ends in a merge

Steps, in execution order
  S01  tx 1  cancel offer 826680: sells 0.0000002 DUSTA for XLM
             why: Open offer 826680 sells 0.0000002 DUSTA for XLM. Offers are subentries that block the merge, and their
             liabilities stop the balance from moving and the trustline from being removed; it is cancelled with amount
             0.
  S02  tx 1  cancel offer 826681: sells 0.0000002 DUSTC for DUSTB
             why: Open offer 826681 sells 0.0000002 DUSTC for DUSTB. Offers are subentries that block the merge, and
             their liabilities stop the balance from moving and the trustline from being removed; it is cancelled with
             amount 0.
  S03  tx 1  return 0.0000003 DUSTB to issuer GDC7...LQEB (burn)
             why: Horizon found no strict-send path to XLM for the full balance. Pay the 0.0000003 DUSTB back to its
             issuer GDC7DOSJT6AIQ74S3T4XQ3YKGDSTNOEXUDJPC36ZMYFBYXD2CG5YLQEB, which burns it.
  S04  tx 1  remove trustline DUSTB
             why: The DUSTB trustline is empty once the balance is disposed of; a trustline is a subentry that blocks
             the merge. Removing it (limit 0) releases its 0.5 XLM reserve to this account.
  S05  tx 1  return 0.0000005 DUSTC to issuer GDC7...LQEB (burn)
             why: Horizon found no strict-send path to XLM for the full balance. Pay the 0.0000005 DUSTC back to its
             issuer GDC7DOSJT6AIQ74S3T4XQ3YKGDSTNOEXUDJPC36ZMYFBYXD2CG5YLQEB, which burns it.
  S06  tx 1  remove trustline DUSTC
             why: The DUSTC trustline is empty once the balance is disposed of; a trustline is a subentry that blocks
             the merge. Removing it (limit 0) releases its 0.5 XLM reserve to this account.
  S07  tx 1  return 0.0000001 SPTA to issuer GDC7...LQEB (burn)
             why: Horizon found no strict-send path to XLM for the full balance. Pay the 0.0000001 SPTA back to its
             issuer GDC7DOSJT6AIQ74S3T4XQ3YKGDSTNOEXUDJPC36ZMYFBYXD2CG5YLQEB, which burns it.
  S08  tx 1  remove trustline SPTA (reserve sponsored by GAFW...GGLE)
             why: The SPTA trustline is empty once the balance is disposed of; a trustline is a subentry that blocks the
             merge. Removing it (limit 0) needs only this account's signature and returns its 0.5 XLM reserve to the
             reserve sponsor GAFW2SI3HWF354G43KDJP74TU2OSNFXMDN7OTYXAGTW3MNCRJLUKGGLE, not to this account.
  S09  tx 1  delete data entry "dustin.fixture"
             why: Data entry "dustin.fixture" is a subentry that blocks the merge; a manage-data operation without a
             value deletes it.
  S10  tx 2  sell 0.0000007 DUSTA for XLM: path payment, quote 0.0000007, at least 0.0000006
             why: Sell the full 0.0000007 DUSTA for about 0.0000007 XLM (at least 0.0000006) with a strict-send path
             payment to this account; the XLM leaves with the merge. It runs in its own transaction so a moved market
             cannot roll back the rest.
  S11  tx 2  remove trustline DUSTA
             why: The DUSTA trustline is empty once the balance is disposed of; a trustline is a subentry that blocks
             the merge. Removing it (limit 0) releases its 0.5 XLM reserve to this account.
  S12  tx 3  merge into GBQG...DH2C (cannot be undone)
             why: Every subentry is removed by the earlier steps; the account sponsors nothing, is not immutable and the
             destination exists. The merge sends the whole XLM balance to
             GBQGFM635UIV2BTCTYSMKKJBESY47VXZLCIPGKW3GZJSSY6B45U2DH2C and deletes the account. It cannot be undone.

Transactions (3, each fee-bumped by the sponsor; inner fee 0)
  tx 1  cleanup    9 ops   bid 1,000 stroops
             Deterministic cleanup with no market dependency (offer cancellations, returns to issuers, transfers to the
             destination, removal of emptied trustlines and data entries), grouped into one fee-bumped transaction of at
             most 100 operations.
  tx 2  convert    2 ops   bid 300 stroops
             Market-dependent sale of DUSTA isolated with its trustline removal, so a moved market cannot roll back the
             rest of the close.
  tx 3  merge      1 op    bid 200 stroops
             The merge runs alone after a fresh preflight, because the path payments before it depend on the market and
             could change the plan.

If everything succeeds
  4.0000007 XLM arrives at GBQG...DH2C (balance 4.0000000 + sale 0.0000007)
  Reserves released to sponsors: 0.5000000 XLM, never this account's
    0.5000000 XLM reserve unlocked for sponsor GAFW...GGLE (trustline SPTA)
  0.0000000 XLM paid by the account; every fee is sponsored
  sequence guard ok: sequence at merge 20935049285206023 is below ledger 4,874,328 << 32
  plan hash 25be835c88e84af36e96e17fa00fcbf465f6f39a7c6075deab940106eff38c85
"
`;

