  tx 1  cleanup    1 op    bid 200 stroops
             Deterministic cleanup with no market dependency (offer cancellations, returns to issuers, transfers to the
             destination, removal of emptied trustlines and data entries), grouped into one fee-bumped transaction of at
             most 100 operations.

Cannot be disposed of (the account is not merged while these remain)
  TRUSTLINE_NOT_AUTHORIZED  0.0000005 DUST (issuer <G...>)
    Issuer <G4> has not authorized the DUST trustline (or revoked
    it), so the balance of 0.0000005 DUST cannot be sent anywhere, not even back to the issuer.
    remedy: Ask the issuer <G4> to authorize the trustline again
    (SetTrustLineFlags), then run the plan again.

Accounting
  0.0000000 XLM arrives at <G...> (nothing: the plan does not merge)
  Reserves released to sponsors: none
  0.0000000 XLM paid by the account; every fee is sponsored
  plan hash <hash1>

Not executed: the plan cannot end in a merge (status PARTIAL), so nothing was signed or submitted.
  TRUSTLINE_NOT_AUTHORIZED  0.0000005 DUST (issuer <G...>)
    Issuer <G4> has not authorized the DUST trustline (or revoked
    it), so the balance of 0.0000005 DUST cannot be sent anywhere, not even back to the issuer.
    remedy: Ask the issuer <G4> to authorize the trustline again
    (SetTrustLineFlags), then run the plan again.
To run everything else now, add --partial: the steps above run, the account is not merged.
"
`;

